WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:01.600
♪ (SOMBER MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:01.934 --> 00:00:03.035
MARY MALONE:
<i> All right, okay.</i>

00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:04.971
(ELECTRONIC HUMMING)

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:07.073
VOICE: (FROM COMPUTER)
<i> Ask a question.</i>

00:00:09.341 --> 00:00:11.577
♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:11.677 --> 00:00:14.246 line:0%
JANE TRANTER:
<i> Angels are creatures of dust.</i>

00:00:14.346 --> 00:00:16.916 line:0%
<i> We discover that
 through Mary Malone,</i>

00:00:17.016 --> 00:00:17.917 line:0%
<i> an Oxford scholar.</i>

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:20.019
And is dust dark matter?

00:00:20.119 --> 00:00:21.287
VOICE:<i> Yes.</i>

00:00:21.621 --> 00:00:22.555
What are you?

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:24.757
VOICE:<i> Angels.</i>

00:00:24.924 --> 00:00:26.692
♪ (UPLIFTING MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:29.462 line:0%
JAMES MCAVOY:
<i> Angels exist across worlds.</i>

00:00:29.929 --> 00:00:33.832 line:0%
<i> A coalescence of dust
 into a sentient, active being.</i>

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:35.535
BALTHAMOS:
Don't be afraid.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:39.539
We're not going to hurt you.

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:41.740
What are you?

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:43.276
BALTHAMOS:<i> Bene elim.</i>

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.746
Angels in your language.

00:00:46.846 --> 00:00:47.713
Angels?

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:50.283 line:0%
TRANTER:<i> They have
 very human characteristics.</i>

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:51.884 line:0%
<i> They fall in love.</i>

00:00:51.984 --> 00:00:54.054 line:0%
<i> Balthamos and Baruch
 for example,</i>

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:56.723
<i> are a very strong,
 romantically linked couple.</i>

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:00.260
<i> The bond between Balthamos
 and Baruch is very strong,</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.829
<i> and where one goes,
 the other feels.</i>

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:06.933
<i> They are sometimes known
 as the watchers,</i>

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.070
<i> in that they watch over
 some worlds.</i>

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.840
VOICE:<i> Making.</i>

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:17.543
<i> Stimulating. Guiding.</i>

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:18.611
But why?

00:01:19.646 --> 00:01:21.081
VOICE:<i> Vengeance.</i>

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:23.649 line:0%
TRANTER:
<i> They have long ago,</i>

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:26.953 line:0%
<i> been thrown out
 of the Kingdom of Heaven,</i>

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:30.757 line:0%
<i> through rebelling against
 the rule of the Authority.</i>

00:01:31.157 --> 00:01:35.461
XAPHANIA:
<i> We, who fought for truth,
 were cast out of the kingdom.</i>

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:37.763 line:0%
MCAVOY:<i> Xaphania is the leader
 of the rebel angels.</i>

00:01:37.863 --> 00:01:41.401 line:0%
<i> She has been leading
the rebel angels for a millennia</i>

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.135 line:0%
<i> and joins forces with me.</i>

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:44.704
The great betrayer.

00:01:46.939 --> 00:01:49.476
Wasn't a millennia in exile
not degradation enough for you?

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:53.179
The kingdom as we know it
has already gone, Alarbus.

00:01:53.913 --> 00:01:55.948
This is our final rebellion.

00:01:56.749 --> 00:01:57.917 line:0%
MCAVOY:
<i> It's a difficult relationship</i>

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:01.054 line:0%
<i> because angels and humans
are so far away from each other</i>

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:03.455 line:0%
<i> in terms of their perspective
 on life.</i>

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.559
If I have to incarcerate
every angel, I will.

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:10.663
If I have to take a knife
to the heart of the Authority
himself, I will.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.499
♪ (MUSIC INTENSIFIES) ♪

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:14.867
(SHOCKWAVES PULSATING)

00:02:14.967 --> 00:02:16.836
(GRIMACING IN PAIN)

00:02:17.170 --> 00:02:18.271
♪ (TENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:21.374
(WINGS FLUTTERING)

00:02:23.008 --> 00:02:23.910
(PAINED GROAN)

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:29.214
(GRUNTING)

00:02:29.314 --> 00:02:31.050
I am Lord Asriel Belacqua.

00:02:31.151 --> 00:02:33.019
I intend to march upon
the Kingdom of Heaven,

00:02:33.119 --> 00:02:34.821
and I should very much
like you to join me.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:37.190
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:41.327 line:0%
JAMES MCAVOY:
<i> Asriel is a revolutionary</i>

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.762 line:0%
<i> and freedom fighter.</i>

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:46.733
<i> He finds his allies</i>

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:50.236 line:0%
<i> and begins building the base
 for the rebellion.</i>

00:02:52.404 --> 00:02:54.373
Welcome to
the Republic of Heaven,
Commander.

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:57.610
The real war is coming,
and we must win it.

00:02:58.110 --> 00:03:01.914 line:0%
JAMES:<i> Asriel's Republic is
 a military encampment</i>

00:03:02.014 --> 00:03:04.149
<i> for science, ingenuity,</i>

00:03:04.249 --> 00:03:06.552
<i> and his military forces
 to gather.</i>

00:03:06.652 --> 00:03:11.057 line:0%
JANE TRANTER:<i> Asriel's council
is made up of Commander Ogunwe,</i>

00:03:11.157 --> 00:03:13.659 line:0%
<i> who looks after
 all operational matters.</i>

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:16.729
<i> Ruta Skadi brings
 clans of the witches.</i>

00:03:17.129 --> 00:03:21.333
<i> Xaphania,
 the light angel equivalent
 of Metatron's dark angel.</i>

00:03:21.433 --> 00:03:22.735
The great betrayer.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.737
You speak of betrayal

00:03:25.805 --> 00:03:29.442
when you have taken orders
to kill one of our own kind.

00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:31.578
COMMANDER ROKE:
Lord Asriel.

00:03:32.078 --> 00:03:32.945
Roke.

00:03:33.045 --> 00:03:34.413 line:0%
JANE:<i> And Commander Roke,</i>

00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:36.148 line:0%
<i>the leader of the Gallivespians</i>

00:03:36.248 --> 00:03:38.084 line:0%
<i> and the whole of
 the spy network.</i>

00:03:38.184 --> 00:03:39.185
What is it?

00:03:39.285 --> 00:03:41.721
A message from
our Magisterium spy,

00:03:41.821 --> 00:03:42.688
Agent Salmakia.

00:03:43.222 --> 00:03:45.624
<i> She says they're preparing
 to undertake a search mission.</i>

00:03:45.724 --> 00:03:47.827
-LORD ASRIEL:<i> For what?</i>
-ROKE:<i> Your daughter.</i>

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:50.896
<i> They think she is
 the most important child
 that's ever lived.</i>

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.568 line:0%
JAMES:<i> Asriel's end goal
 is to fight the Authority.</i>

00:03:56.335 --> 00:03:57.770
<i> And what he learns</i>

00:03:57.870 --> 00:04:00.139
<i> is that it's a slightly
 different kind of fight.</i>

00:04:00.239 --> 00:04:01.140
What is this?

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:02.775
It's a Gallivespian
communication device.

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:05.411
We have a message from
our agent in the Magisterium.

00:04:05.978 --> 00:04:08.481
<i>We're about to land on a remote
 island in the German Ocean.</i>

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:10.984
I'll take the intention craft.
It's the fastest way.

00:04:11.717 --> 00:04:12.752
<i> Understood.</i>

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.488
Try not to die.

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:17.189
(SCOFFS)

00:04:17.489 --> 00:04:19.925
♪ (EPIC MUSIC PLAYING) ♪

00:04:20.025 --> 00:04:20.859
Why are you following us?

00:04:21.527 --> 00:04:23.229
LADY SALMAKIA: I am a member
of Lord Asriel's republic.

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:27.133
I'm here for you, and the girl,
and your knife.

00:04:27.233 --> 00:04:29.469
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:35.408 line:0%
JANE TRANTER:<i> The Gallivespians
 are very, very small creatures</i>

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:39.311 line:0%
<i> who Asriel uses
 as his spy network.</i>

00:04:40.045 --> 00:04:42.348
COMMANDER ROKE:
Lord Asriel. Your daughter, sir.

00:04:42.448 --> 00:04:44.317
Salmakia believes
she's in danger.

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:46.318
When is Lyra not in danger?

00:04:46.752 --> 00:04:49.621
TRANTER:<i> Commander Roke
 is the Gallivespian</i>

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:51.991
<i> who sits on Asriel's council.</i>

00:04:52.091 --> 00:04:55.627
<i>He has Gallivespians positioned
 all over the world</i>

00:04:55.727 --> 00:04:58.731
<i> and they communicate with him
 and give him information.</i>

00:04:58.831 --> 00:05:01.733
<i> Agent Salmakia, for example,
 is positioned</i>

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:03.769
<i> in the headquarters
 of the Magisterium.</i>

00:05:03.869 --> 00:05:07.106
<i> So she can tell Roke
what the Magisterium are up to.</i>

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:11.577
Retrieve the child.
Retrieve the mother.

00:05:12.411 --> 00:05:16.616
And return them to me...
dead or alive.

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:21.219 line:0%
TRANTER:<i> They communicate
using this really strange device</i>

00:05:21.320 --> 00:05:23.122
<i>called the lodestone resonator.</i>

00:05:23.222 --> 00:05:25.190
<i> Which means that
 they can communicate</i>

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:26.726
<i> across the worlds.</i>

00:05:27.426 --> 00:05:28.928
Lodestone resonating,
go ahead.

00:05:29.028 --> 00:05:30.863
SALMAKIA:<i> We're about to land
 on a remote island</i>

00:05:30.963 --> 00:05:32.031
<i> in the German Ocean.</i>

00:05:32.632 --> 00:05:34.533
Agent Salmakia,
get to the children,
get them to safety,

00:05:34.633 --> 00:05:35.701
then stay with them
until I arrive.

00:05:35.801 --> 00:05:37.570
-Understood?
-SALMAKIA:<i> Understood.</i>

00:05:38.004 --> 00:05:39.772 line:0%
JAMES MCAVOY:
<i> They're quite prickly.</i>

00:05:39.872 --> 00:05:41.874 line:0%
SALMAKIA: You've been lying
this whole time.

00:05:42.507 --> 00:05:44.043
The knife is broken.

00:05:44.477 --> 00:05:45.678
LYRA SILVERTONGUE:
Stop attacking him.

00:05:45.778 --> 00:05:47.580
SALMAKIA: Give me one reason
why I should.

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:50.783
MCAVOY:
<i> But quite honorable as well.</i>

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:52.918
Because Asriel needs him safe.

00:05:53.318 --> 00:05:55.053
Whatever you're doing,
do it quickly.

00:05:55.554 --> 00:05:57.523
This war will need us all.

00:05:59.157 --> 00:06:01.960
LADY SALMAKIA:<i> We're about to
 land on a remote island
 in the German Ocean.</i>

00:06:02.227 --> 00:06:03.128
<i> Fairisle.</i>

00:06:03.896 --> 00:06:05.464
LORD ASRIEL:<i> I know the place.
 I'll take the Intention Craft.</i>

00:06:05.698 --> 00:06:07.833
♪ (PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:11.703 line:0%
JANE TRANTER:
<i> The Intention Craft
 is a machine that,</i>

00:06:11.804 --> 00:06:13.839
<i>through the intent of his mind,</i>

00:06:13.939 --> 00:06:17.410
<i> will allow Asriel to journey
 through different worlds.</i>

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.311
The craft may not be ready
for this.

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:22.014
Well then, that is
on the pair of us, is it not?

00:06:22.114 --> 00:06:23.816
(ENGINE WHIRRS)

00:06:24.316 --> 00:06:26.585
TRANTER:<i> The force
 between himself and his daemon</i>

00:06:26.685 --> 00:06:28.454
<i> powers the Intention Craft.</i>

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:30.956
MARISA COULTER:
<i> So your daemon powers it</i>

00:06:31.056 --> 00:06:33.458
<i>and your intentions control it,
 am I right?</i>

00:06:34.226 --> 00:06:37.630
I don't think he'd want you
to be looking at them
quite so forensically.

00:06:39.098 --> 00:06:41.967 line:0%
TRANTER:<i> Mrs. Coulter looks over
 some plans for it,</i>

00:06:42.067 --> 00:06:46.072 line:0%
<i> and we see her exploring it
 before Asriel arrives.</i>

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:49.374
<i> And then we just see her
 having the sort of pluckiness</i>

00:06:49.474 --> 00:06:51.077
<i> to get in it
 and just give it a go.</i>

00:06:58.283 --> 00:07:00.052
Marisa!

00:07:03.021 --> 00:07:04.424
Goodbye, Asriel.

00:07:08.727 --> 00:07:11.030 line:0%
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES) ♪

